        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "17. Except for emergencies or other circumstances making it impractical, employees will be given a minimum of five (5) days notice if they are required to work on a holiday. Work assignments on holidays will be filled by requesting volunteers from among employees fully qualified to do the work to be performed. If more volunteer than are needed, assignments will be made in order of greatest seniority. If less volunteer than are needed or none volunteer, assignments will be made among employees fully qualified to do the work to be performed in order of least seniority.",
